{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年38歲的內地女星景甜，今年8月被幣圈富商孫宇晨爆料曾交往，男方豪花巨額聘金求景甜協助代孕，女方最終臨時加價5,000萬美元（約3.9億港元），孫宇晨不肯，雙方代孕計劃告吹。</p><p>外界推測景甜本來是戲劇圈一姐，恐因此被封殺，內媒近日則拍到她和朋</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T18:24:14.430734+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T18:01:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T18:17:31.721495+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T18:17:31.721495+00:00","content_hash":"6af68d25d64a21cc21ccbfade4373e65e9a9931c9b58db71e795e363f6e7681d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}